<% layout("layout") %>

<h1>Text Watermark</h1>
<p class="muted">Embed an invisible watermark in text with zero-width Unicode characters,
or check text for hidden characters and clean them out. Everything runs locally in your
browser — no text leaves this page.</p>

<div class="tool-tabs" role="tablist">
  <button type="button" id="tab-check" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="pane-check">Check &amp; Clean</button>
  <button type="button" id="tab-embed" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="pane-embed">Embed</button>
</div>

<section class="tool-pane" id="pane-check" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-check">
  <div class="tool-field">
    <label for="check-input">Text to inspect</label>
    <textarea id="check-input" rows="6" placeholder="Paste text here…"></textarea>
  </div>
  <div class="tool-actions">
    <button type="button" id="check-run">Check</button>
    <button type="button" id="clean-run">Clean</button>
  </div>
  <div class="tool-report" id="check-report" hidden></div>
  <div class="tool-field" id="clean-output-wrap" hidden>
    <label for="clean-output">Cleaned text</label>
    <textarea id="clean-output" rows="6" readonly></textarea>
    <div class="tool-actions">
      <button type="button" id="clean-copy">Copy cleaned text</button>
    </div>
    <p class="muted">Note: cleaning removes every invisible character, including joiners and
    variation selectors that some composed emoji depend on.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tool-pane" id="pane-embed" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-embed" hidden>
  <div class="tool-field">
    <label for="embed-input">Text to watermark</label>
    <textarea id="embed-input" rows="6" placeholder="Paste the text to protect…"></textarea>
  </div>
  <div class="tool-field">
    <label for="embed-message">Watermark message</label>
    <input type="text" id="embed-message" maxlength="200" placeholder="e.g. © desunit 2026, copy #42">
  </div>
  <div class="tool-actions">
    <button type="button" id="embed-run">Embed watermark</button>
  </div>
  <div class="tool-report" id="embed-report" hidden></div>
  <div class="tool-field" id="embed-output-wrap" hidden>
    <label for="embed-output">Watermarked text</label>
    <textarea id="embed-output" rows="6" readonly></textarea>
    <div class="tool-actions">
      <button type="button" id="embed-copy">Copy watermarked text</button>
    </div>
    <p class="muted">The output looks identical to the input, but it carries your message as
    zero-width characters. Paste it into the Check tab to verify.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tool-notes">
  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <p>The watermark message is encoded as UTF-8 bits and written with zero-width characters:
  <code>U+200C</code> (zero-width non-joiner) for 0, <code>U+200D</code> (zero-width joiner)
  for 1, wrapped in <code>U+2060</code> (word joiner) markers. The payload is inserted after
  the first word, where it survives most copy-paste operations. Check &amp; Clean detects and
  removes four families of suspect characters: invisible Unicode (zero-width spaces, joiners,
  soft hyphens, variation selectors), exotic spaces (no-break, en/em, ideographic, braille
  blank — normalized to a plain space), bidi controls and isolates, and Unicode tag
  characters (<code>U+E0000</code>–<code>U+E007F</code>).</p>

  <h2>Weak points</h2>
  <p>This is a lightweight tracer, not a secure watermark. The <strong>Clean</strong> tab
  strips it, many platforms drop zero-width characters, and it never survives a retype,
  screenshot, or Unicode normalization. It works only for tracing a leak in a closed channel,
  and only until someone cleans or retypes the text.</p>

  <h2>Stronger methods</h2>
  <p>For AI-generated text, statistical watermarks (e.g. Google SynthID-Text) survive
  copy-paste and light edits, but only work on text you generate yourself, and they live in
  the word choice rather than in hidden characters — so cleaning invisible characters does not
  remove them. The durable use of this page is defensive: <strong>Check &amp; Clean</strong>
  finds hidden characters used to smuggle instructions into AI systems or slip past filters.</p>
</section>

<script src="<%= it.base %>/assets/text-watermark.js" defer></script>
